    "text": "To look into this, I need a couple of specifics:\n\n- The exact IAM role name (or ARN) for your analytics role\n- The database and table name (I'm guessing `sales` table, but which database?)\n- The AWS account ID and region, if not this agent space's default (012345678901_1, us-east-1)\n\nOnce I have those, I can check the Lake Formation grants, the role's IAM policy, and the underlying S3 data location permissions \u2014 Access Denied in Athena with an LF grant in place is almost always one of those three not lining up."
